  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pages:
  - "Unknown:\tyou\u2019ve been corrupted, your right eye\u2014\u2014  GET OUT OF
    THERE!\u2014\u2014\r"
  - "System: \tsyste- restar-ting\u2026\r\nSystem:\tWelc-me new user\r\nSystem:\tScaning\u2026\r\nSystem:
    \tVision mismatch detected. Y-y-your right eye is corrupted. \r\n\t\tPotential
    side effects include discomfort and hallucinations\r\n\r\nSystem: \tHowever,
    there is a chance you might be able to see alien \r\n\t\tobjects invisible to
    the human eye. \r\nSystem: \tReminder: b-ee careful of distinguishing between
    human \r\n\t\tobjects and alien objects. \r\nSystem: \tVision may be impaired-
    ALERT! ALERT! All units compromised. \r\n\t\tReturn to base immediately. Find
    a way to leave the spaceships. \r\r\n"
  - "System:\tHint! Use your alien vision to see things your human eyes \r\n\t\tcan\u2019t
    see.\r"
